{
    "version": "1.4.0",
    "description": "IDA Pro MCP - AI 辅助逆向工程的 MCP 桥接工具",
    "homepage": "https://github.com/mrexodia/ida-pro-mcp",
    "license": "MIT",
    "url": "https://github.com/mrexodia/ida-pro-mcp/archive/refs/tags/1.4.0.zip#/ida-pro-mcp.zip",
    "hash": "0116464e4083f8920a0eda39b42c5dc42b71381661cab70247b13fb3b0fa81aa",
    "extract_dir": "ida-pro-mcp-1.4.0",
    "suggest": {
        "python": "uv",
        "ida-pro": "ida-pro"
    },
    "pre_install": [
        "Set-Content \"$dir\\ida-pro-mcp.bat\" '@pushd %~dp0', '@uv run ida-pro-mcp %*', '@popd' -Encoding Ascii",
        "Set-Content \"$dir\\idalib-mcp.bat\" '@pushd %~dp0', '@uv run idalib-mcp %*', '@popd' -Encoding Ascii",
        "Set-Content \"$dir\\ida-mcp-test.bat\" '@pushd %~dp0', '@uv run ida-mcp-test %*', '@popd' -Encoding Ascii",
        "Set-Content \"$dir\\ida-mcp-trace-dump.bat\" '@pushd %~dp0', '@uv run ida-mcp-trace-dump %*', '@popd' -Encoding Ascii"
    ],
    "post_install": [
        "uv venv \"$dir\\.venv\"",
        "uv pip install -e \"$dir\" --python \"$dir\\.venv\\Scripts\\python.exe\""
    ],
    "bin": [
        "ida-pro-mcp.bat",
        "idalib-mcp.bat",
        "ida-mcp-test.bat",
        "ida-mcp-trace-dump.bat"
    ],
    "checkver": "github",
    "autoupdate": {
        "url": "https://github.com/mrexodia/ida-pro-mcp/archive/refs/tags/$version.zip#/ida-pro-mcp.zip",
        "extract_dir": "ida-pro-mcp-$version"
    },
    "notes": [
        "【工具类型】: 安全测试工具（MCP 桥接服务）",
        "【主要功能】: 将 MCP 客户端连接至 IDA Pro，实现 AI 驱动的二进制逆向分析与漏洞挖掘",
        "【适用场景】: 软件逆向工程、漏洞研究、恶意代码分析、CTF 解题",
        "【技术特点】: 基于 Python 3.11+ 开发，使用 uv 管理虚拟环境，支持 IDA Pro 8.3+（推荐 9.x）",
        "【注意事项】: 需安装 IDA Pro 并通过 idapyswitch 配置 Python 环境；IDA Free 版本不受支持；首次使用请执行 ida-pro-mcp --install 将插件部署至 IDA 插件目录；需通过 py-activate-idalib.py 激活 idalib"
    ]
}
